      "widgets_values": [
        "H3 Scripted Multi-Shot Lengthy Video  -  TURBO / 9:16 / auto-refs / advanced prompts\n\n1.  Pick Orientation and Size  ->  PORTRAIT 768 x 1344.\n2.  Select Per-Shot Duration  ->  5 s (= 124 frames).\n1.  H3 Script Writer  -  premise -> short shot-by-shot script.\n1b. H3 Story Expander (optional)  -  longer, more detailed script.\n2.  H3 Script Review (Gemini)  -  logic/physics + hook-first.\n3.  Plan + render all shots:\n    REFS (auto_refs on): one still per element in ref_entities is\n      generated up front via ref_backend (Gemini, one shared chat)\n      and every shot is anchored to them (MiniMaxH3ReferenceToVideo).\n      ref_entities = 'kind | name | description' per line; blank =\n      read [CHARACTER:]/[ENVIRONMENT:]/[PROP:] blocks from the script.\n    ADVANCED PROMPTS (advanced_prompts on): after each shot is drafted,\n      a final pass folds the CAMERA MOVE LIBRARY (output/\n      sample_prompts.md) + FILM LOOK EXTENSIONS (system_prompts/\n      film_extensions.md) into the prompt. film_look = auto | none |\n      Game of Thrones | The Matrix | TRON: Legacy | Avatar | The\n      Odyssey | Interstellar | John Wick  (held across the whole video).\n    TURBO: speed_lora = ...turbo_4step_v0.1_comfy, strength 1.0,\n      sigma_shift 0 (-> 6). Auto 8 steps + euler. ddim_uniform refused.\n    BRAND: brand_logo = cinevault small logo.png (circular badge,\n      bottom-right, opaque; node crops the square backing itself).\n    Output -> SaveMp4  (output/34_00001.mp4).\n4.  H3 Video Review (Gemini)  -  samples frames vs the script.\n\nBlackout end card is added in post from\noutput/instagram_reels/blackout_end_card.mp4 (not in this graph).\nRestart ComfyUI (Pinokio Stop/Start) after pulling new node code."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
